msgid ""
"Managing a modern fish farm means tracking dozens of variables in real time "
"— dissolved oxygen, pH, ammonia, temperature, feed conversion ratios, and "
"mortality rates. Suderra's aquaculture software platform connects to every "
"sensor on your facility and unifies all data into one system."
msgstr ""
"Å drive et moderne oppdrettsanlegg betyr å følge dusinvis av variabler i "
"sanntid – oppløst oksygen, pH, ammoniakk, temperatur, fôrfaktor og "
"dødelighet. Suderras programvareplattform for akvakultur kobles til alle "
"sensorene på anlegget og samler alle data i ett system."

msgid ""
"Many issues in RAS facilities can be prevented at the design stage: "
"correctly sized biofilters, good water flow, secured financing and a well-"
"trained team. We support you at every step, from the first drawing to a "
"running farm."
msgstr ""
